OL,5,G1700 Cornwall: A Year by the Sea
OL,6,     FIn Padstow harbour, a fisherman
OL,7,     Ftries an innovative way of
OL,8,     Fcatching scallops with illuminated
OL,9,     Fpots. In Fowey, children learn the
OL,10,     Fskills that have shaped the town's
OL,11,     Fmaritime heritage.
